{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22176","headline":"咏拙 · 白居易","name":"咏拙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"所禀有巧拙，不可改者性。\n所赋有厚薄，不可移者命。\n我性愚且惷，我命薄且屯。\n问我何以知，所知良有因。\n亦曾举两足，学人蹋红尘。\n从兹知性拙，不解转如轮。\n亦曾奋六翮，高飞到青云。\n从兹知命薄，摧落不逡巡。\n慕贵而厌贱，乐富而恶贫。\n同此天地间，我岂异於人。\n性命苟如此，反则成苦辛。\n以此自安分，虽穷每欣欣。\n葺茅爲我庐，编蓬爲我门。\n缝布作袍被，种谷充盘飧。\n静读古人书，闲钓清渭滨。\n优哉复游哉，聊以终吾身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}